{
  "about": "wheel-calibration for Linux, whose page has no title bar: the timeline is 38 px higher than on macOS and Windows, so the wheel events are over y 66. After the notched ticks and the trackpad deltas come fractions of a tick, as a high-resolution wheel sends them. Chromium reads 120 px from an X11 wheel notch, three of the 40 px ticks (X03). Elsewhere the events miss the timeline and the captures show nothing but that",
